   "originalText": "If your test harness gives each simulated WebSocket connection its OWN event loop (e.g. Starlette's TestClient, by default),\nbroadcasting between two connections open in ONE test hangs forever — a cross-event-loop await. Fix: share one event\nloop/portal per test client. Production never hits this: one process serves every connection on one loop.",
